## Interface: 16001
## Title: TwizOpen
## Notes: Automatically opens chests, boxes, gifts, clams, shells and other openable containers in your bags. Skips locked lockboxes and never opens while you're in combat, looting, or at a vendor, bank, mailbox, trade or Auction House.
